.PD
clang is now the only supported compiler
.IP \(bu 4
A single test failure remains for the core Perl test suite
.Sp
It is for a misleading warning message in an edge case for reading
malformed UTF\-8 in \fIXS\-APItest/t/utf8_warn00.t\fR.  (Several instances of
the same failure occur.)
.IP \(bu 4
Some cpan modules shipped with core have known problems:
.RS 4
